*** Numbers to Know
**** Caching
***** Key Metrics
****** - ~1 millisecond latency \n - 100k+ operations/second \n - Memory-bound (up to 1TB)

***** Scale Triggers
****** - Hit rate < 80% \n - Latency > 1ms \n - Memory usage > 80% \n - Cache churn/thrashing

**** Databases
***** Key Metrics
****** - Up to 50k transactions/second \n - Sub-5ms read latency (cached) \n - 64 TiB+ storage capacity

***** Scale Triggers
****** - Write throughput > 10k TPS \n - Read latency > 5ms uncached \n - Geographic distribution needs

**** App Servers
***** Key Metrics
****** - 100k+ concurrent connections \n - 8-64 cores @ 2-4 GHz \n - 64-512GB RAM standard, up to 2TB

***** Scale Triggers
****** - CPU > 70% utilization \n - Response latency > SLA \n - Connections near 100k/instance \n - Memory > 80%

**** Message Queues
***** Key Metrics
****** - Up to 1 million msgs/sec per broker \n - Sub-5ms end-to-end latency \n - Up to 50TB storage

***** Scale Triggers
****** - Throughput near 800k msgs/sec \n - Partition count ~200k per cluster \n - Growing consumer lag

